# (build 145) The five recruits' portraits (Rudo 2, Amy 3, Hugh 4, Anna 5,
# Kain 6; the pictures rudo, amy, hugh, anna, kain) from their pictures:
# five of the twelve no route drew after build 142 (see
# paseo_hospital_picture). Both of Rolf's house's portrait loads in the
# middle of a scene: a newcomer at the door (RolfHouse_Arrival, loc_B282)
# and SEE STRENGTH (loc_B118), whose list loads the chosen member's
# portrait.
#
# The counters as they stand when Kain knocks: Anna the last to join
# (members puts Rolf, Rudo and Anna in the party, party_members_joined 5)
# and Kain sent (join-next 6). In at Rolf's door: the knock ($090C), Kain's
# introduction ($0923) with Rolf's own window beside his, NO to renaming
# him, the roster ($090E), then SEE STRENGTH for each of the five, and
# OUTSIDE.

start level 4 45 19                 # Paseo, under Rolf's door
members Rolf Rudo Anna
join-next 6
wait screen level
wait idle
walk up 3                           # one step, then the door takes the pad
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $090C                 # "There's a knock at the door."
press c
wait idle
expect script $0923                 # Kain
expect picture 56 64 kain
expect picture 258 70 rolf
shot 01_kain_arrives
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect menu $20                     # rename him? YES / NO
press down
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $090E
expect menu $29                     # SEE STRENGTH / REORGANIZE / OUTSIDE
press c
wait idle
expect menu $2A
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect picture 56 64 rudo
shot 02_rudo_strength
press c
wait idle
expect menu $29
press c
wait idle
expect menu $2A
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect picture 56 64 amy
shot 03_amy_strength
press c
wait idle
expect menu $29
press c
wait idle
expect menu $2A
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect picture 56 64 hugh
shot 04_hugh_strength
press c
wait idle
expect menu $29
press c
wait idle
expect menu $2A
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect picture 56 64 anna
shot 05_anna_strength
press c
wait idle
expect menu $29
press c
wait idle
expect menu $2A
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect picture 56 64 kain
shot 06_kain_strength
press c
wait idle
expect menu $29
press down
press down
press c                             # OUTSIDE
wait idle
expect script $0909
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 45 18
expect picture 56 64 none
expect no-stderr not ported
